{"id":"35fe1ee97b4ca429","group":"88","path":"88/88-cor-compactness-fo.md","title":"Compactness for First-Order","display":"cor-compactness-fo — Compactness for First-Order","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-cor-compactness-fo","aliases":["88-cor-compactness-fo"],"display":"cor-compactness-fo — Compactness for First-Order","depends_on":["[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-satisfiable]]","[[88-thm-compactness]]","[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-cor-compactness-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-cor-compactness-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-compactness-fo — Compactness for First-Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (set of first-order sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S\\)</span> (satisfiability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Psi\\subseteq\\Phi\\;\n\\bigl(|\\Psi|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Psi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Psi\\subseteq\\Phi\\;\n\\bigl(|\\Psi|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Psi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Psi|&lt;\\aleph_0\">\\(|\\Psi|&lt;\\aleph_0\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span>为有限集</li>\n<li>紧致性定理的一阶逻辑形式 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a>)</li>\n<li>模型论的核心工具</li>\n<li>Löwenheim-Skolem的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"07d05f02304a849d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-satisfiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"